## Safety Tools

Before starting, make sure all players are comfortable with:

- **Lines and Veils**: Which topics are off-limits and which require a "can we go there?" check before continuing.
- **X-Card**: Any player can raise a card to pause or rewind a scene with no questions asked.
- **Session check-ins**: Briefly ask how players felt about the previous session.

